  message: "DEEP bakeoff: ArkLib (163 Lean files, 6 Python scripts) generates all 5 forward slices from Python main() functions (confidence 0.47-0.53) instead of Lean library_export symbols (confidence 0.32-0.33). Fix: when one language constitutes >95% of files, boost its entrypoint scores proportionally. Or: guarantee at least 1 slice from the primary language regardless of absolute confidence."  # 8b24
